"Parallel gathers multiple indices on non-trailing dimensions and copies data"
" zero-copy from global memory (GM) directly to the correct position in the "
"unified buffer (UB) in tile units. This operation is equivalent to the high-"
"performance implementation of `torch.index_select`, suitable for embedding "
"layer lookup, sparse index access, and other scenarios."

